  "body": "## Summary\n\nThe `preview` column was added to the Codex CLI `threads` table in a recent update. Older local `~/.codex/state_5.sqlite` databases lack this column, causing `/api/usage-history` and other Codex-backed endpoints to fail when the dashboard queries Codex data.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Split the Codex query into `_fetch_rows_with_preview()` and `_fetch_rows_without_preview()` helpers.\n- Try the full query first; on `sqlite3.OperationalError` for missing `preview`, retry with the column-less query.\n- Use `row.keys()` before reading `preview` in the title fallback path.\n- Add regression coverage for an older Codex state schema without the `preview` column.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `uv sync`\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app.DashboardApiTests.test_codex_records_support_older_state_without_preview_column -v`\n- `scripts/review.sh` (32 tests pass; Python compilation passes)\n\nCloses #29",
  "changed_files": 2,
